whether it's being around other people. I go in, I get terrified, nothing bad happens. I go in, I get terrified, nothing bad happens. Gradually, gradually, I develop a new learning that in this environment, in this context, I'm safe, which is paired with the sensor control because it's not forced upon the person, right? We don't throw a person with the dog in the room and close the door on them.

